  "content": "<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">注意：此「模組」僅新增合成配方，您仍需要安裝原始的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/drive-by-wire\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Drive-By-Wire</a> 模組！</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>這個擴充套件為 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/drive-by-wire\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Drive-By-Wire</a> 模組中所有缺乏合成配方的物品新增了對應配方。安裝後您就能在生存模式中使用此模組。所有配方都非常簡單且製作成本相當低廉！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>以下是一些精彩截圖：</p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_35d564f7-76ac-47c7-95e9-edd3c6a5b5f4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"493\" height=\"265\"></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_99f4429f-0c89-43b9-bd9f-8689e4c69048.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"489\" height=\"270\"></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_42f1d1c8-6447-45f3-b466-0ddf8f984019.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"478\" height=\"266\"></span></p>",
